@@@!atrep-exo
@=bibliogramma=>bibtex

@@/ classic BibTeX export: the lossy legacy surface. Modern
@@/ genera collapse (media and legal types to misc, thesis to
@@/ phdthesis, report to techreport, reference works to book),
@@/ date narrows onto year, location onto address, issue onto
@@/ number.

@-> *document
@(grammata)
>-@

